  "description": "I woke up from a drunken stupor to find myself in a strange forest that felt completely unreal. \n\n\\[Welcome to the Continental Unified Community!\\] \n\nWith no idea what was going on, Jong-Hyeok, stranded in the forest, saw a gallery he’d only ever seen online appear as a hologram right before his eyes. From the Heavenly Horse of the Central Plains to the Empire’s Swordmaster, this gallery brings together the continent’s most powerful figures. In this place, where he must survive solely on the items and information they send him, it’s said to be the wilds known as the “Forest of the Four Seasons”—a place from which no one has ever returned alive once they’ve entered...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
